title: "Roof material classification and green-roof cooling scenarios"
abstract: >-
  Code for semantic enrichment of 3D city models with roof material classes
  derived from aerial orthophotos, and for modelling the land surface
  temperature effect of green-roof interventions on the enriched buildings.
